text = "Controls:

KBM:
Camera: Move with mouse
Move: WASD, Arrow Keys
Jump: Space
Sprint: Shift
Super Sprint: Shift + Ctrl

Duplicate object: 1
Delete object: 0
Pick up object: E
Put down object: Q
Enter Supermenu: ESC

Nothing else to say :)"
