text = "Controller:

Camera: Right thumbstick
Move: Left thumbstick, D-Pad
Jump: B, A, or equivalent
Sprint: Xbox Y or equivalent
Super Sprint: Xbox Y + Xbox X

Duplicate object: Left bumper, Click left thumbstick
Delete object: Right bumper, Click right thumbstick
Pick up object: Left trigger
Put down object: Right trigger
Enter Supermenu: Menu buttons"
